# 14. Ethernet Type Values

Important Ethernet Type values from the lesson:

| Protocol | EtherType |
| -------- | --------- |
| IPv4     | `0x0800`  |
| ARP      | `0x0806`  |
| IPv6     | `0x86DD`  |

The `0x` indicates hexadecimal.

