# 17. GNS3 vs Packet Tracer

### Packet Tracer

* Network **simulator**
* Free
* Very useful for CCNA labs
* Used throughout the course

### GNS3

* Runs actual Cisco IOS software virtually
* More realistic in some ways
* GNS3 itself is free
* Cisco IOS images must be obtained separately

For CCNA:

> **Packet Tracer is sufficient for most of the required practice.**

